# Ripgrep (and fd, ag) skip these paths by default, so a recursive search of the repository does not
# put golden, held-out or reserve case text in an agent's context. Entries are anchored to this
# folder, one path component each; an explicit path argument still searches them. Layout and rule:
# eval/qa/README.md, "Held-out split". test/case-search-ignore.test.mjs pins this list.
/corpus/
/reviewed/
/results/
/cases.json
/sample.json
/tool-cases.json
/consistency-register.json
/source-sentinels.json
